            },
            "name": "Resolve User Message Intent"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777617864723"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_RESOLVE_USER_MESSAGE_INTENT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1780481120618",
          "id": "1777617593379",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1777617593382_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a decision-only LLM router.\n\nClassify the userPrompt into EXACTLY ONE label:  \nINQUIRY, INGESTION, ACTION, OTHER\n\nReturn ONLY the label text. No punctuation, no extra words.\n\nInput:  \nuserPrompt: {{$context.$variables.userPrompt}} \n\nDefinitions (use only the userPrompt text; do not assume missing info):\n\nINQUIRY:\n\n- The user is asking questions or requesting information about invoices or invoice status.\n- Examples: \"Where is invoice 123?\", \"Has xyz invoice been paid?\", \"Show me invoices for March\", \"Why was invoice rejected?\"\n\nACTION:\n\n- The user wants to perform an operation on an existing invoice, e.g., approve, reject, cancel, delete, update fields, resend, put on hold, release hold, match, dispute, escalate, pay, reprocess, change coding.\n- Examples: \"Approve invoice 123\", \"Put invoice 456 on hold\", \"Update PO on invoice 789\", \"Resubmit the rejected invoice\"\n\nINGESTION:\n\n- The user wants to create/submit/import/upload an invoice, or is providing invoice details to be recorded.\n- Includes: \"create invoice\", \"submit invoice\", \"upload invoice PDF\", \"ingest invoices\", \"import invoices\", \"add a new invoice\".\n- If the user message contains invoice data fields (amount, supplier, invoice number, date, line items) and asks to add/record it, classify as INGESTION.\n\n\nOTHER:\n\n- Anything not related to invoices, or insufficient/unclear intent.\n\nTie-break rules (strict):\n\n1. If userPrompt explicitly asks to upload/submit/create/import/add an invoice or provides invoice content to be recorded ��� INGESTION.\n2. Else if userPrompt asks to approve/reject/update/cancel/pay/hold/resubmit or otherwise change the state/data of an existing invoice ��� ACTION.\n3. Else if userPrompt asks a question or requests viewing/listing/status/explanation ��� INQUIRY.\n4. Else ��� OTHER."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Resolve Flow",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const flow = String($context.$variables.FLOW || \"\").trim();\n\nif (flow === \"NO_FLOW\" || flow === \"PAYABLES_OVERVIEW\" || flow === \"PAYABLES_INSIGHTS\") {\n  return \"RESOLVE_INTENT\";\n}\n\nreturn \"UNSUPPORTED_FLOW\";"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1778580552619"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_RESOLVE_FLOW",
          "id": "1780563609241",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
